      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BOY"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "오늘은 어때?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "今日はどう？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 7,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_LOVERS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_GIRL"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "어제랑 비슷해.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "昨日と似てるね。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 8,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_LOVERS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BOY"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "정말? 그럼 오늘도 별이 잘 보이겠네. 다행이다!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "本当？じゃあ今日も星がよく見えるね。よかった！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_LOVERS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_GIRL"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "으휴…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "うっ…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_LOVERS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BOY"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "왜?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "どうして？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_LOVERS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_GIRL"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이런 상황에서도 속 편해 보여서.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "こんな状況でも平然として見えるから。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_LOVERS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BOY"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이런 상황?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "こんな状況？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_LOVERS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_GIRL"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "보면 모르겠어? 모든 게 끝났잖아! 갖고 있는 물이랑 식량도 얼마 안 남았고…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "見ればわかるだろ？全部終わったんだぞ！持ってる水も食料もほとんど残ってないのに…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_LOVERS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BOY"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그런데?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "だから何？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_LOVERS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_GIRL"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "별은 언제 터질지 모르고… 도망갈 데도 없고… 최악이야!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "星がいつ爆発するか分からないし…逃げ場もない…最悪だ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_LOVERS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BOY"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "최악은 아니야.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "最悪じゃないよ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_LOVERS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_GIRL"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "뭐?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "何？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 18,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_LOVERS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BOY"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "내 곁에 네가 있잖아.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "僕のそばに君がいるじゃないか。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 19,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_LOVERS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_GIRL"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "참나…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "まったく…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 20,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_LOVERS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_BOY"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그나저나 로맨틱하지 않아? 끝까지 너랑 함께 있을 수 있다니! 안 그래?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ところでロマンチックじゃない？最後まで君と一緒にいられるなんて！そうじゃない？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 21,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_LOVERS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_GIRL"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…뭐, 조금은 로맨틱하네.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…まあ、少しはロマンチックだな。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "DictionaryFinalCut": true
    },
